{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:1aa3138a2dee839a","name":"Droid Oil Bath","source":{"id":"source:reference-1aa3138a2dee839a","title":"Droid Oil Bath","revision":21023,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:00:47Z","sha256":"21a5ee37a43c5e3cb4872d8f9cc2558ea52b4e48334f763c2013a212cc23966a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21023","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Droid%20Oil%20Bath&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-1aa3138a2dee839a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," (600 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},") Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," look forward to an Oil Bath after a long period of work. This standard maintenance procedure lubricates the Droid's servos and joints, allowing the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," to move as if it has just come off the assembly line. A Droid Oil Bath is recommended at least once a week for a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," working in a harsh environment, and once a month for a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," working in a temperate climate or on board a ship.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," immersed in an Oil Bath for at least 30 minutes can activate a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Second Wind"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Second_Wind"},", even if it has already done so that day. The price of a Droid Oil Bath depends on the size of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},": Small ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," and smaller, 100 credits; Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},", 1,000 credits; Large ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},", 5,000 credits; Huge ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," and larger, 10,000 credits.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
